---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import {archive} from '../lib/archive';
---
<Site title="Learn Yorùbá — Words & Pronunciation" active="Learning">
  <header class="wrap page-head">
    <p class="kicker">LEARN THE LANGUAGE · KEEP THE STORIES ALIVE</p>
    <h1>Words carry stories.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Hear the shape of a word in your mind, practise the written tones and explore how Yorùbá names and expressions are used. Every word can open another conversation.</p>
  </header>
  <section class="wrap narrow article-section">
    <nav class="pills" aria-label="Language learning tools">
      <a href="/learning/ifa/">Understanding Ifá &amp; its readings</a>
      <a href="/learning/alphabet/">Alphabet &amp; tone practice</a>
      <a href="/learning/pronunciation/">Pronunciation references</a>
      <a href="/tales/">Stories to read</a>
    </nav>
    <h2>Pronunciation and everyday words</h2>
    <p>Explore fifteen Yorùbá expressions, their meanings and the marks that help distinguish one spoken word from another.</p>
    <p class="fine">Permission-cleared native-speaker recordings are still being prepared; no unreviewed audio is supplied.</p>
    <div class="profile-grid">{archive.pronunciationEntries.map(p=><article class="profile"><h3 lang="yo">{p.text}</h3><p>{p.meaning}</p><p class="fine">{p.note}</p><span class="label">Native recording pending</span></article>)}</div>
    <h2>Words to explore</h2>
    <dl class="glossary">{archive.glossary.map(g=><div><dt lang="yo">{g.term}</dt><dd>{g.meaning}</dd></div>)}</dl>
    <p>Try using a new word when you discuss one of the <a href="/tales/">stories</a>. Does anyone in your family pronounce it differently?</p>
  </section>
</Site>